WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:02.635
-We just played
a game with Dr. Phil

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:03.770
called "Two Truths and a Lie."

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:05.204
-Oh.
-And he's at good at finding --

00:00:05.204 --> 00:00:06.405
-Yeah. Okay.
-He's the best.

00:00:06.405 --> 00:00:08.408
So, I thought...
-Yeah.

00:00:08.408 --> 00:00:10.043
[ Laughter ]

00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:11.477
-Yeah, exactly.
Start working it now,

00:00:11.477 --> 00:00:12.778
because he's already
in your head.

00:00:12.778 --> 00:00:13.913
-Whatever, Dr. Phil.

00:00:13.913 --> 00:00:15.114
I need to meet
the "Cash Me Ousside" girl

00:00:15.114 --> 00:00:15.814
before we talk.

00:00:15.814 --> 00:00:16.883
You know what I'm saying?

00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:17.683
[ Laughter ]

00:00:17.683 --> 00:00:19.052
You know what I'm saying?

00:00:19.052 --> 00:00:21.020
Y'all trying to fix her
with psychology.

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:22.956
She need a 2x4.

00:00:24.023 --> 00:00:26.659
Howbow dah?

00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:28.795
Howbow dah?

00:00:28.795 --> 00:00:29.829
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:32.966
-Yeah, her mama need a 2x4.
-Exactly.

00:00:32.966 --> 00:00:35.368
All of them.
-Let's hear -- Let's --

00:00:35.368 --> 00:00:38.071
-Okay.
-Think of a truth or a lie...

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:39.471
-Okay.
-...and have Dr. Phil --

00:00:39.471 --> 00:00:40.540
He'll judge you on it

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:42.174
and see if you're telling
a truth or a lie.

00:00:42.174 --> 00:00:43.343
-Oh, okay.

00:00:43.343 --> 00:00:46.446
Um, I got chased through
a drive-through by a car.

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:49.482
[ Suspenseful music plays ]

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:51.584
On a date.

00:00:56.823 --> 00:01:00.226
-[ Clears throat ]

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:03.029
You got chased
through a drive-through

00:01:03.029 --> 00:01:05.832
by a car on a date?

00:01:05.832 --> 00:01:08.334
-On a date.

00:01:08.334 --> 00:01:09.836
-What kind of drive-through?

00:01:09.836 --> 00:01:12.305
-Uh, it was McDonald's.

00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:15.241
-McDonald's?
Did you already have your food?

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:17.410
-No, I ordered the food.

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:18.878
-What did you order?

00:01:18.878 --> 00:01:22.649
-A sundae with no nuts, 'cause
he wanted to hit me with his.

00:01:22.649 --> 00:01:24.750
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:29.789
[ Cymbal crashing ]

00:01:29.789 --> 00:01:32.692
-Yeah.

00:01:32.692 --> 00:01:35.361
[ Closing theme plays ]

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:43.502
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:43.502 --> 00:01:46.071
-Sorry to interrupt.
Where were we?

00:01:46.071 --> 00:01:48.774
-Let me tell you --
This girl is telling the truth.

00:01:48.774 --> 00:01:50.743
-Yes.
-Are you?

00:01:50.743 --> 00:01:52.044
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:52.044 --> 00:01:53.713
So, you got it from that?

00:01:53.713 --> 00:01:56.082
He's that amazing.
You're that amazing.

00:01:56.082 --> 00:01:58.884
My thanks to
Leslie Jones and Dr. Phil.

00:01:58.884 --> 00:02:00.920
A date?
-Yeah.

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:02.255
-We'll be right back
with a performance

00:02:02.255 --> 00:02:04.557
from Rick Ross
featuring Young Thug and Wale.

